    {
        "text": "The Commander of the Defense Forces does not linger on the streets after leaving the school."
    },
    {
        "text": "He came alone. There are none of his men in the vicinity."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "She must find Adams and get the news out."
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter how amicable the commander looked, there must be a reason why he came to the school."
    },
    {
        "text": "Molly does not know, and neither do the children, but Golding does."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
