    },
    {
        "text": "Why are there so many Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "The path to the bookstore is a familiar one. She has tread it countless times in the past two years."
    },
    {
        "text": "But today, the path seems much longer than she remembers. She cannot see the end of it. She remembers the day that the Sarkaz came."
    },
    {
        "text": "Can she truly change?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must believe. I must...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fear seizes Golding by the throat."
    },
    {
        "text": "She feels as though she is about to throw up. She turns and flees."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
