    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Molly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did anything happen while I was away?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No. Lance and Patty were scared. Ralph and the older kids took the little ones to get some rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. I've been thinking... the children will enjoy the play, won't they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Our hard work will mean something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No... nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't mind the Commander of the Defense Forces, Ms. Golding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I'm not feeling well. I need some rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Molly. Could you clean up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There should be an end to the play. The Steam Knights arrived at the palace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The children will perform the final scene in a few days, won't they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Absolutely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -300,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There sure are lots of possibilities, so long as the conclusion of the story hasn't yet been told.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But even a play that's been performed can be changed. People always look for the latest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been watching for a long time, haven't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "blackstart": 0.2,
        "blackend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The stage is right here. Why don't we start from the beginning, from act one?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "blackstart": 0.2,
        "blackend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone dreams about how things would have been, if none of this had happened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "blackstart": 0.2,
        "blackend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "'What ifs' mean nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if there is even a remote possibility...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why don't you join us on stage, sir?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Molly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
