        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The mysterious spectator takes a step forward, his gaze moving from his counterpart to the distance."
    },
    {
        "text": "He is not building up tension, but recalling memories of another battlefield, memories that have lain dormant for too long."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "32_i02",
        "xScale": 1.2,
        "yScale": 1.2,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 150
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "image": "32_i02",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "xScaleFrom": 1.2,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.2,
        "xScaleTo": 1.15,
        "yScaleTo": 1.15,
        "xfrom": 0,
        "yfrom": 150,
        "xTo": 0,
        "yTo": 150,
        "duration": 10
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "It is not a king that I serve, but honesty and courage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Mysterious Spectator'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Destruction awaits, if you stay on this path.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "text": "The destruction of the individual is nothing, compared to having to watch a tyrant bring this country to ruin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Mysterious Spectator'"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you know her end, sir?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can predict her end, as I know her beginning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Mysterious Spectator'"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could you reminiscence about the past, young as you are?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who can keep the sun from setting? Such desires are the greatest greed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Mysterious Spectator'"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have seen countless acts of madness performed in the name of preserving this glory. They turn to banditry, or fight amongst themselves, ultimately accelerating the decay of this country.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Mysterious Spectator'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
